# cslcore venom: the discovery web
Output docs/assets/venom.gif
Source docs/assets/tapes/_settings.tape
Set Height 1090
Set Framerate 24

Hide
Type "export PS1='\[\e[1;36m\]$\[\e[0m\] ' PATH=$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH && cd /tmp/csl-demo && clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Type "cslcore venom --root host --no-save"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 12s
